  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e95750f108e433543aef0099027763ad, type: 3}
  m_Name: PreBossFight
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entryLines:
  - text: "Vid\xED\u0161 to taky?"
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "Vid\xEDm! Co to proboha je?"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "Varna \xDAn\u011Btick\xE9ho piva! Mus\xED\u0161 ji zni\u010Dit, to ona
      ur\u010Dit\u011B m\u016F\u017Ee za tu hr\u016Fzu tady! "
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "K \xFAtoku m\u016F\u017Ee\u0161 vyu\u017E\xEDt lehk\xFD \xFAtok nebo pomoc\xED
      branick\xE9ho plastov\xE9ho dvoulitru tak\xE9 i t\u011B\u017Ek\xFD \xFAtok
      stisknut\xEDm kl\xE1vesy S. Ten zp\u016Fsobuje v\u011Bt\u0161\xED po\u0161kozen\xED,
      ale fla\u0161ka je to t\u011B\u017Ek\xE1, tak ten \xFAtok trv\xE1 d\xE9le. "
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "J\xE1 tu mezit\xEDm z\u016Fstanu schovan\xFD. Ne \u017Ee bych se b\xE1l,
      ale nechci si od t\xE9 chcanky zamazat kab\xE1t."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  choices: []
